{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "65c65f1b8947fdc40024c323c3cf2999a5bb6643052b664ee467d2f09c3dd88d", "ja": "ドラマ撮影のお仕事中", "zh": "戏剧拍摄工作中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d22b429dc49eddae51a2ec36ef74bed9e708feda9cc57ec8ddd2f9c5c52b7bf8", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあの、次のシーンで使うお衣装なのですが……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n请问，关于下一幕要使用的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4002_p", "source_sha256": "dce21c39d0d7fe0ef653645ede93b7ef7b0a6fac14493b2447b1e096fa987f04", "ja": "ああ、結婚式のシーンで着物を着るんだったな。\n結婚式らしい華やかな柄だけど、何か問題があるのか？", "zh": "喔喔，是要在婚礼的场景穿和服吧。\n那是适合婚礼的华丽花样，有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "94fbd72857cfec6cb7759a63d8052582bb51c630503fb31870f6011ffced552b", "ja": "ですが、これは銘仙です。普段着用の物ですから、\n特別な場に着ていくには、いささか場違いです。", "zh": "但这是平织的布料，是平时穿着的衣服，\n要穿到特殊场合有些不合时宜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "464677598d29e4b2dc5f58df06d1e5c2fdf52bec99c987fd9c537e1d69348f2d", "ja": "これは無礼な人物を演じろという指示なのでしょうか。\nそれとも、私のような人間は場違いだ、という……？", "zh": "这是要我演出无礼角色的指示吗？\n或是要暗示我这样的人不合时宜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4005_p", "source_sha256": "d1ae2fdb46f389b047317557839079204a64bec71a27c494be6c902c1a13f412", "ja": "いやいや、考えすぎだ、考えすぎ！\nスタッフさんが、着物に詳しくないだけだと思うよ。", "zh": "不不不，你想太多，想太多了！\n我想应该只是工作人员对和服不熟悉而已吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4006", "source_sha256": "5e04c3fd26b67ce7c799a60cd6b788797b569f8f7cff8bdbf8419adb562ec6f0", "ja": "こっそり衣装を変える", "zh": "偷偷更换服装", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4007", "source_sha256": "332ea9e9ac58768d29b4147e4533933cc4cbd256fb93ba37077a5865c346f56c", "ja": "紬に納得させる", "zh": "说服䌷", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4008", "source_sha256": "22345e94e0269276ec2209208800c3f3cef66bf06db9a97b892c4b4db4eadfa8", "ja": "監督に変更を申し出る", "zh": "向导演提出更改", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4100_p", "source_sha256": "38a5faf180094c373f47ef810effc900ae1277ddbd58c2769ab9c441c239f036", "ja": "紬は、確か着物を持ってたな。\n「もしもの時のために」……今が、その「もしも」だ！", "zh": "印象中，䌷你有带着和服吧。\n「为了应付突发状况」……现在就是「突发状况」了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4101_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cee8b3d29013a100cac730fce9365ac8f3dcf8d84b5c5f979a19058b178059b7", "ja": "か、監督に許可を取らなくてよいのですか？\n問題になった時は、誰が責任を……。", "zh": "不、不用经过导演同意吗？\n要是出了问题，由谁来负责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4102_p", "source_sha256": "b3a981246ab9f68afbb010c9c74b152188892a3970c97c1c585b4a2c245b6725", "ja": "その時は、俺が責任を取るから心配するな。\n紬は何も心配せず、自分の役をしっかり演じてくれ。", "zh": "要是出问题，我会负起责任的，别担心。\n䌷不用多想，努力演好自己的角色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4103_051tmg", "source_sha256": "75d65698548ec838803e3919243f59d04984c287058e8e965480bf219cc6b96e", "ja": "っ……は、はい。わ、わかりました……。", "zh": "……好、好的，我、我知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4104_p", "source_sha256": "8963427d8bb82a1afc79c6613e6c1cdf1bd3a91a9d5d979090d0ecd268959da1", "ja": "（実際、監督は着物の柄なんて覚えていなかった。\n場面にピッタリな紬の着物姿は、ただただ絶賛された）", "zh": "（实际上，导演根本不记得和服的花样，\n䌷穿着和服的模样正适合剧中场景，结果大受称赞。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4105_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4b7c4c069e94822937c1928a1175c59548b4da9f1206a32bd4205c710712dc98", "ja": "現場の判断を優先すべきときも、あるのですね。\nあなたには、ときどき驚かされます……。", "zh": "有时候也该以第一线的判断为优先呢，\n你经常让我感到惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4106_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dea305d5630037eae18e310a8beb9b0df42e18be049216aca39096fa7f21a7a2", "ja": "何にせよ……その。え、ええと……。\nあ、ありがとうございました……。", "zh": "无论如何……那个，呃……\n谢、谢谢你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4200_p", "source_sha256": "befa13c33c90a60c6ae11ea4bb1271dbfc0a54ce491f542fd580ed99beb56290", "ja": "紬の意見はもっともだが、監督の意向もあるだろうし\n……すまない。ここは、我慢して着てくれないか？", "zh": "䌷提出的意见很正确，但导演应该也有自己的想法……\n抱歉，你可以忍耐一下，先穿这件吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4201_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a4b5d5aed226765a1b37c0a14ea127c80989909de463e38c4940bb7ac87427a1", "ja": "……それは……。いえ、承知しました。\n事情があるのでしょうから、無理にとは申しません。", "zh": "……这样……不，我了解了。\n应该是有什么原因，我不会坚持己见的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4202_p", "source_sha256": "056c9b295e3de602504fe975f30fc47957b6940eeb8849b09c15f6bb2afa7a59", "ja": "（その後、撮影はつつがなく進行したが……\n紬の表情は、晴れないままだった）", "zh": "（之后，顺利进行了拍摄……\n但䌷的表情一直闷闷不乐的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4300_p", "source_sha256": "d65c934f847f6c274ed422350c10d90a6d05623c8886a47716f2d16695d06fb1", "ja": "よし、わかった。\n変更してくれるよう、監督にかけあってみよう。", "zh": "好，我知道了。\n我去和导演谈谈，看能不能更改服装吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4301_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f027ec522c3eb0a9615ca58a355927d1a397a239bf759f1efc21d6d77d764c09", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？\nあの……よろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "咦，真的吗？\n那个……拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4302_p", "source_sha256": "0ef90d7a57bc8533b278a80caddda7c239119baec6f0c00f1be8e3b869fc0f43", "ja": "（だが根回しが上手くいかず、監督は機嫌を悪くして\nしまった。おかげで、撮影現場の空気は最悪に……）", "zh": "（但我未能顺利说明，惹导演不悦了，\n拍摄现场的气氛也因此变得十分糟糕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_4303_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c828890ce013c117adff94ad063a6c349cd432b8cf5b1e817d5bdf67cb48ebf5", "ja": "私は、間違っていないはずですが……。\nやはり、このお仕事に向いていないのでしょうか……。", "zh": "我应该没有说错才是……\n也许我还是不适合这份工作吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
